│  - Q: I was charged twice for the same order. What do I do?                 │
│    A: Duplicate charges are usually refunded automatically within 5         │
│  business days. If not,                                                     │
│    contact support with both transaction IDs for manual review.             │
│  - Q: My card payment failed. Will my order be cancelled immediately?       │
│    A: No, the order stays in "pending payment" for 24 hours so you can      │
│  retry. After 24 hours                                                      │
│    without a successful payment, it is automatically cancelled.             │
│  - Q: What happens to my remaining installments if I return the product?    │
│    A: Future installments are cancelled, and the installments already       │
│  charged are refunded                                                       │
│    following the standard credit card refund timeline (1 to 2 billing       │
│  cycles).                                                                   │
│  - Q: Will I be charged extra for using a foreign credit card?              │
│    A: Possibly, but that fee is set and charged by your card issuer or      │
│  bank, not by us — we                                                       │
│    don't control or collect international transaction fees.                 │
│  - Q: Can I cancel just one item from a multi-item order?                   │
│    A: Yes, and the refund is calculated proportionally for the cancelled    │
│  item only, using the                                                       │
│    same payment method and refund timeline as a full cancellation.          │
│  - Q: Should I dispute a charge with my bank instead of contacting          │
│  support?                                                                   │
│    A: We recommend contacting support first. Bank/card disputes place the   │
│  order on hold for                                                          │
│    30–90 days while the issuer investigates, which is usually slower than   │
│  our direct refund                                                          │
│    process.                                                                 │
│  - Q: Do you support recurring/subscription payments?                       │
│    A: No, all purchases are one-time payments. We do not offer              │
│  subscription or recurring                                                  │
│    billing at this time.                                                    │
│                                                                             │
