│  Duplicate Charges                                                          │
│  If a customer is charged more than once for the same order due to a        │
│  processing error, the                                                      │
│  duplicate charge is automatically identified and refunded within 5         │
│  business days. If it is                                                    │
│  not refunded automatically within that window, the customer should         │
│  contact support with                                                       │
│  both transaction IDs for manual review.                                    │
│                                                                             │
│  ---                                                                        │
│                                                                             │
│  Source: specific_payment_cases.md                                          │
│  Failed Payment Retry Policy                                                │
│  If a credit or debit card payment fails (e.g., insufficient funds, card    │
│  declined), the                                                             │
│  order is held in "pending payment" status for 24 hours, during which the   │
│  customer can retry                                                         │
│  with the same or a different payment method. After 24 hours without a      │
│  successful payment,                                                        │
│  the order is automatically cancelled and the reserved stock is released.   │
│                                                                             │
